<title>USA: Schering-Plough OKs revised rights plan.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough OKs revised rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schering-Plough Corp said Tuesday it approved a revised shareholder rights plan, replacing the plan due to expire in 1999.</p>
<p>The company said it approved the redemption, effective July 10, of the company's outstanding preferred share purchase rights at the redemption price of $0.00125 per outstanding right and declared a dividend distribution of one new preferred share purchase right on each outstanding share of Schering-Plough common stock to replace the rights being redeemed.</p>
</text>
